description: |
    Manual tests are no longer filtered out by the
    :ref:`/plugins/discover/fmf` and :ref:`/plugins/discover/shell`
    plugins. They are now discovered as any other test, and the
    :ref:`/plugins/execute/tmt` executor reports them with the
    ``skip`` result instead of them being silently dropped during
    discovery. Deciding which tests can be executed is left to the
    execute step, which paves the way for executors able to guide a
    human through a manual test.

    Note that a plan containing manual tests only now finishes with
    the "all tests skipped" exit code ``4`` instead of "no test
    results found" ``3``. Use ``--condition 'manual is False'`` to
    restore the previous test selection.
